# Deploy Web App

- [/] Explore project configuration <!-- id: 0 -->
    - [x] Check for [firebase.json](file:///d:/nexonn/go_buddy_app/go_buddy/firebase.json) <!-- id: 1 -->
    - [x] Check for [.firebaserc](file:///d:/nexonn/go_buddy_app/go_buddy/.firebaserc) (Likely missing) <!-- id: 1b -->
    - [x] Verify `flutter` and `firebase` CLI availability <!-- id: 2 -->
- [x] Build Flutter Web App <!-- id: 3 -->
    - [x] Configure [firebase.json](file:///d:/nexonn/go_buddy_app/go_buddy/firebase.json) and [.firebaserc](file:///d:/nexonn/go_buddy_app/go_buddy/.firebaserc) <!-- id: 3b -->
