- [/] Deploy to Hosting <!-- id: 5 -->
    - [x] Initialize Firebase Hosting if needed (`firebase init hosting`) <!-- id: 6 -->
    - [x] Run `firebase deploy --only hosting` <!-- id: 7 -->
